  "notes": "USAGE:\nAn intransitive verb. The transitive counterpart is ⟦{泡立|あわだ}てる→泡立てる：06419_awadateru⟧ (to whip, to beat into foam). Commonly used in cooking and daily life contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦ビール→ビール：01015_biiru⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{泡立|あわだ}つ (beer foams)\n- せっけん⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{泡立|あわだ}つ (soap lathers)\n- {泡立|あわだ}つ⟦{波|なみ}→波：00868_nami⟧ (foaming waves)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{泡立|あわだ}てる→泡立てる：06419_awadateru⟧: to whip, to beat — transitive partner\n- ⟦{沸|わ}く→沸く：01122_waku⟧: to boil — specifically for boiling liquids, not foaming",
